0f&oh=00_AQIAh1i3IS6ebZQZOedkmQRoVVDY0wRpD14JB-sNh7YwYw&oe=6AA0098E"}, {"file_name": "META App page_Screenshots - 2560px x 1440px-15.png", "id": "1610465123412280", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1610465126745613_529628666071862288_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y5tK4en-jZwQ7kNvwF_EBHm&_nc_oc=AdqfcnSI79u2NVHdR261AjNPIJBh29SDkbGtzXFZ3R22c2QjxFwULfQwRcSnHFcgfB0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ0Yg0exZU8O-O_nkiUZs82XkMgJWs7WN0vjvpXaav_OQ&oe=6AA00F66"}, {"file_name": "META App page_Screenshots - 2560px x 1440px-13.png", "id": "1870640326990417", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1870640330323750_8002609030324663600_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6W0XSPqAKocQ7kNvwEY3YBK&_nc_oc=AdpGq0k8afgJVLncOKqLjscJMDoieHS1VPbE3y5bexIP307IGkCYUVJ3Mb3x50Jvcrc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIV-JkKXZRMBr5WD8oB9JPK63U56hh9EDDS8sAOxRyrCQ&oe=6AA02DF4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "META App page_Landscape - 2560px x 1440px.png", "id": "1856323875023788", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818852_1856323878357121_912182294544512_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qL_ICkKZsEIQ7kNvwEnjFH1&_nc_oc=AdrWhaAhS3Tl6My0B_w--GYbw0ACXbjGarB7b6iYaR8PRVereurHUO-XRlR_J30ZRKo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIOXARcd4u2mNyUGaKLhDVdmyZfX4AgkHBJ9AhTo4YFVA&oe=6A9FFEBB"}, "display_name": "Reactivity", "keywords": ["partygame", "ouuly", "reactivity", "party", "memory"], "long_description": "# **\u26a1Reactivity | Better than yesterday.**\n\nTurn your living room into a high-tech training arena. **Reactivity** is a cutting-edge **Mixed Reality** experience built in **Unreal Engine**, designed to push your limits and sharpen your reflexes. By seamlessly blending digital challenges with your physical environment through advanced **Passthrough** technology, Reactivity delivers a training session that feels as real as it gets.\n\n## **Compete for the Top Spot**\nWhile many VR games isolate you, Reactivity is designed to be the **life of the party**. Reactivity intelligently splits your environment into a high-intensity **Gaming Zone** and a dedicated **Spectator Area**, making it just as much fun to watch as it is to play. Who has the fastest hands in the house? Reactivity features **Local Leaderboards**, making it the perfect **\"pass-and-play\"** experience. Challenge your friends and family, compare your reaction times, and see who truly reigns supreme in your household.\n\n### **Master Your Senses**\nDon't just play\u2014evolve. \n\n* **Discern Ability**: Can you keep your cool under pressure? Identify target shapes among a sea of decoys as the speed ramps up.\n* **Memory Ability**: Focus is key. Track color-marked objects as they fade and move through your room. \n* **Visual Reaction**: How fast do you dare to be? Set your own reaction threshold\u2014the faster you react, the higher you score. But be careful: one slip-up costs is high!\n* **Sound Reaction**: Using precision **Spatial Audio**, you must locate, turn, and strike targets in 3D space with millisecond accuracy.\n", "short_description": "\u26a1 Reactivity: Better Than Yesterday\n\nTurn your home into a high-tech MR arena!\nReactivity is a competitive Mixed Reality party game that pushes your reflexes and memory to the limit.\n\nMaster 4 modes: Discern and Memory Ability, Visual and Sound Reaction. Use Passthrough to blend digital challenges with your world.\n\ud83c\udfc6 Local Leaderboards: Challenge friends in your living room and prove who\u2019s fastest. Sharpen your senses and beat your yesterday. Are you ready?"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1465590184957644", "locale": "cs_CZ", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Reactivity", "keywords": ["p\u00e1rty", "ouuly", "reactivity", "reflex", "pam\u011b\u0165"], "long_description": "# **\u26a1Reactivity | Better than yesterday.**\n\nProm\u011b\u0148 sv\u016fj ob\u00fdv\u00e1k v high-tech tr\u00e9ninkovou ar\u00e9nu. **Reactivity** je \u0161pi\u010dkov\u00fd z\u00e1\u017eitek v **Mixed Reality**, vytvo\u0159en\u00fd v **Unreal Engine**, navr\u017een\u00fd tak, aby posouval tvoje limity a zost\u0159il tv\u00e9 reflexy. D\u00edky plynul\u00e9mu propojen\u00ed digit\u00e1ln\u00edch v\u00fdzev s tv\u00fdm fyzick\u00fdm prost\u0159ed\u00edm pomoc\u00ed pokro\u010dil\u00e9 technologie **Passthrough** p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00ed Reactivity tr\u00e9nink, kter\u00fd p\u016fsob\u00ed maxim\u00e1ln\u011b realisticky.\n\n## **Sout\u011b\u017e o prvn\u00ed m\u00edsto**\n\nZat\u00edmco mnoho VR her t\u011b izoluje, Reactivity je navr\u017eena jako skute\u010dn\u00fd **st\u0159ed pozornosti**. Chyt\u0159e rozd\u011bluje tv\u00e9 prost\u0159ed\u00ed na intenzivn\u00ed Hern\u00ed z\u00f3nu a samostatnou Z\u00f3nu pro div\u00e1ky, tak\u017ee sledov\u00e1n\u00ed je stejn\u011b z\u00e1bavn\u00e9 jako samotn\u00e9 hran\u00ed. Kdo m\u00e1 doma nejrychlej\u0161\u00ed ruce? Reactivity nab\u00edz\u00ed **Lok\u00e1ln\u00ed \u017eeb\u0159\u00ed\u010dky**, d\u00edky \u010demu\u017e je ide\u00e1ln\u00ed pro **\u201est\u0159\u00eddej se a hraj\u201c** styl hran\u00ed. Vyzvi sv\u00e9 p\u0159\u00e1tele a rodinu, porovnejte reak\u010dn\u00ed \u010dasy a zjist\u011bte, kdo je u v\u00e1s doma skute\u010dn\u00fdm \u0161ampionem.\n\n### **Ovl\u00e1dni sv\u00e9 smysly**\n\nNehraj jen\u2014vyv\u00edjej se.\n\n* **Schopnost rozli\u0161ov\u00e1n\u00ed:** Dok\u00e1\u017ee\u0161 zachovat chladnou hlavu pod tlakem? Identifikuj c\u00edlov\u00e9 tvary mezi mno\u017estv\u00edm klamn\u00fdch objekt\u016f, zat\u00edmco tempo neust\u00e1le roste.\n\n* **Pam\u011b\u0165:** Soust\u0159ed\u011bn\u00ed je kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9. Sleduj barevn\u011b ozna\u010den\u00e9 objekty, jak miz\u00ed a pohybuj\u00ed se po tv\u00e9 m\u00edstnosti.\n\n* **Vizu\u00e1ln\u00ed reakce:** Jak rychl\u00fd si troufne\u0161 b\u00fdt? Nastav si vlastn\u00ed reak\u010dn\u00ed limit\u2014\u010d\u00edm rychleji reaguje\u0161, t\u00edm vy\u0161\u0161\u00ed sk\u00f3re z\u00edsk\u00e1\u0161. Ale pozor: jedna chyba t\u011b m\u016f\u017ee st\u00e1t hodn\u011b!\n\n* **Reakce na zvuk:** D\u00edky p\u0159esn\u00e9mu **Spatial Audio** mus\u00ed\u0161 lokalizovat, oto\u010dit se a zas\u00e1hnout c\u00edle v 3D prostoru s p\u0159esnos", "short_description": "\u26a1 Reactivity: Better Than Yesterday\n\nProm\u011b\u0148te sv\u016fj domov v hi-tech MR ar\u00e9nu!\nReactivity je kompetitivn\u00ed p\u00e1rty hra pro sm\u00ed\u0161enou realitu (MR), kter\u00e1 prov\u011b\u0159\u00ed va\u0161e reflexy a pam\u011b\u0165 na maximum.\n\nOvl\u00e1dn\u011bte 4 hern\u00ed re\u017eimy: Rozpozn\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed, Pam\u011b\u0165, Vizu\u00e1ln\u00ed reakce a Zvukov\u00e9 reakce. D\u00edky funkci Passthrough plynule propoj\u00edte digit\u00e1ln\u00ed v\u00fdzvy se sv\u00fdm skute\u010dn\u00fdm sv\u011btem.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Lok\u00e1ln\u00ed \u017eeb\u0159\u00ed\u010dky: Vyzv\u011bte p\u0159\u00e1tele p\u0159\u00edmo u v\u00e1s v ob\u00fdv\u00e1ku a doka\u017ete, kdo je nejrychlej\u0161\u00ed.\n\n\ud83e\udde0 Zost\u0159ete sv\u00e9 smysly: P\u0159ekonejte sv\u00e9 v\u010derej\u0161\u00ed j\u00e1.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ouuly.com/reactivity", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ouuly innovations s.r.o.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.ouuly.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT",